# Shared project config, committed so every teammate and every deploy works out of the box.
# ONLY publishable values belong here: they are embedded in the browser bundle anyway.
# Never put secrets in this file (the repo is public). Put them in .env.local instead:
#   - ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (enables Claude in Ask)
#   - any Supabase service_role key (never needed by this app)

